## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
Broadcom is a leading beneficiary of the AI revolution, with strong ties to cloud providers and networking infrastructure. While peers like NVIDIA (AI-focused) or AMD (compute-intensive) have higher growth rates, AVGO offers better fundamentals and valuation discipline.  

**Bull Case:** AI adoption accelerates, driving data center capex and Broadcom’s market share in custom ASICs.  
**Bear Case:** Consumer semiconductor demand weakens, or foundry costs rise, squeezing margins.  

**Verdict: BUY** with a focus on the long-term secular growth story.  

